### 1. 查询宝宝：把返回结果中的 id 复制到下面的 @babyId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/babies

### 2. 开始睡眠：先替换 @babyId 的值，再点请求行左边的绿色三角
@babyId = 618b988e-9588-4c64-9da8-b010c52e3f40
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sleep-sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "babyId": "{{babyId}}",
  "startedAt": "2026-07-31T12:30:00Z"
}

### 3. 结束睡眠：把上一步响应中的 id 复制到 @sleepSessionId
@sleepSessionId = 在这里粘贴睡眠会话的id
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sleep-sessions/{{sleepSessionId}}/end
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endedAt": "2026-07-31T14:00:00Z"
}

### 4. 查询当天睡眠记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/sleep-sessions?babyId={{babyId}}&date=2026-07-31

### 5. 查询当天喂养和尿布记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/care-records?babyId={{babyId}}&date=2026-07-31
### 6. 今日真实数据简报
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/daily-summary?babyId={{babyId}}&date=2026-07-31
### 7. 近期七天增长时间线
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/growth-timeline?babyId={{babyId}}&days=7

### 8. Ask the AI assistant (start Python on port 8000 for the rule-based reply)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "babyId": "{{babyId}}",
  "message": "今天睡得怎么样？"
}
### 9. Create an AI conversation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "babyId": "{{babyId}}"
}

### 10. Load latest AI conversation
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/conversations/latest?babyId={{babyId}}

### 11. Load messages (replace conversation id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages

### 12. Register a Manbo demo account (run once)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "parent1",
  "displayName": "妈妈",
  "password": "change-me"
}

### 13. Login after the account already exists
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "parent1",
  "password": "change-me"
}

### Copy accessToken from request 12 or 13 here (do not include Bearer)
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### 14. Create or claim the baby's private family room
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-chat/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "babyId": "{{babyId}}"
}

### Copy the returned room id here
@familyRoomId = paste-room-id-here

### 15. Load private family messages
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-chat/rooms/{{familyRoomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 16. Send a message; Java gets the sender from the JWT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-chat/rooms/{{familyRoomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "刚刚记录了 120 ml 奶。"
}

### 17. Load message history again
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-chat/rooms/{{familyRoomId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### 18. Owner creates a one-time family invite (24 hours)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-invites
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "babyId": "{{babyId}}"
}

### Copy inviteCode above and a second account's accessToken here
@inviteCode = paste-invite-code-here
@secondAccessToken = paste-second-account-token-here

### 19. Second signed-in account joins the baby's family
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-invites/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{secondAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{inviteCode}}"
}

### 20. Run again to verify one-time use; expected response is 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/family-invites/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{secondAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "{{inviteCode}}"
}
